摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Archived-session manager for DSH Web UI: reopen an archived session and keep chatting, unarchive it back in place, or hard-delete a session — grouped panel with message search and native view sync.","id":"gh:1335249242","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-archive-manager","slug":"jasonrale/dsh-archive-manager","topics":["cordis-plugin","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","session-management","session-management-dashboard"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Archived-session manager for DSH Web UI: reopen an archived session and keep chatting, unarchive it "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"back in place, or hard-delete a session — grouped panel with message search and native view sync."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-archive-manager"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An archived-session manager for DeepSeek Harness WebUI: an \"Archived\" entry at the sidebar footer op"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ens a grouped archive panel — open a session to continue it, unarchive, or delete it (full live-agen"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"t teardown + physical log removal)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Native DSH only has the \"archive\" action (hides the session from the sidebar); there is no way to vi"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ew, restore, or delete archived sessions. This plugin fills that gap."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Archive list** — an \"Archived\" entry at the sidebar footer opens a panel grouping sessions by wo"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"rkspace, visually matching the official sidebar\n- **Continue a session** — click an archived session"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" to open it and keep chatting; its archived state is untouched\n- **Unarchive** — put a session back "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"into its workspace with one click, original position preserved\n- **Delete for good** — safely stops "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"the session first, then removes its complete on-disk record; a confirmation dialog guards the action"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"\n- **Search** — instant filtering by title or workspace, plus message search (your prompts and the a"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ssistant's replies); behaves like the official search\n- **View sync** — grouping (by workspace / one"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" list), ordering (manual / recently updated), and drag-to-reorder all stay in real-time two-way sync"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" with the official sidebar\n- **Bilingual UI** — English and Chinese, following the system language a"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"utomatically\n- Session status at a glance: running / completed / waiting for you — same as the offic"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"y\n- Session status at a glance: running / completed / waiting for you — same as the official sidebar"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Developed against `@deepseek-ai/dsh` **0.1.0-rc.6**. Relies on official internal shapes (`workspaceR"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"egistry.enqueueOperation`, `AgentHandle.dispose`, the client-runtime service shapes); a dsh upgrade "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"may require adaptation — if something misbehaves after upgrading, check whether this repo has caught"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" up with the new version."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Updating"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then restart dsh web."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Sessions that were running while the plugin itself was **hot-reloaded** cannot be deleted afterwar"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ds — the plugin will refuse with a clear message asking you to restart dsh first. (Normal use is una"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ffected: install once, and everything — including sessions archived before the plugin existed — stay"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ll once, and everything — including sessions archived before the plugin existed — stays manageable.)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
